[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m lower-level ones (`printLine`, `bad`, `good`) are exercised **directly**, not
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m only through the `driver` wrapper:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
