[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **B. Runtime options/modes.** Exactly one: `driver`'s `useGood` `int`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `if (useGood)` is a full 32-bit test against zero (`cmpl $0, -0x4(%rbp)`), so the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m axis is *zero* vs. *any non-zero bit pattern*, not `0` vs `1`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **C. Input shapes the code distinguishes.** `printLine`'s pointer is the only
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m data input:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * NULL vs non-NULL (the `if`), covered in `ERRORS.md`;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * string length: 0, 1, small, page-crossing, multi-MiB (`puts` internals switch
